This week in Linear

Customer requests
Link issues to the customers who asked for them. Pull from Intercom, Zendesk, Slack, or email, and see revenue and request count on every issue so prioritization stops being a guess.

Asks in Slack
Turn any Slack message into a Linear issue with a reaction. The thread stays linked, and the requester is notified when the issue closes.

Initiatives 2.0
Group projects under company-level initiatives, with a health rollup and an update feed for leadership.

Also shipped: sub-issue progress bars, a Cmd+K action to duplicate an issue, and faster mobile sync.

